OL,3,GNEWSACall to review sentence for driver
OL,4,Awho killed boy
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn MP says she has written to the
OL,7,Fattorney general seeking a review of
OL,8,Fthe jail sentence given to a speeding
OL,9,Fdriver who killed a 12-year-old boy and
OL,10,Ffled to Latvia.
OL,12,FOn Friday, Aleksanders Dolars, 23, was
OL,13,Fsentenced to nine years and four months
OL,14,Fin prison for causing the death of
OL,15,FKeaton Slater by dangerous driving in
OL,16,FCoventry in June 2024.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,354,350,200,160,0,100
